{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1005_null", "source_sha256": "bfdf2c7c108f869cdf415aa398bd426d6b6b9ed617f21876f8e4de41feae1f11", "ja": "月軌道　人工居留施設『フロンティア2』\nG.U.A.F.（世界統合政府軍）前線基地", "zh": "月球轨道　人工居留设施『Frontier 2』\nG.U.A.F.（世界统合政府军）前线基地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "c159138c4842d6247dc6b8ce44ab03fed61234958275892d1a2a1e0bea24e6f8", "ja": "新兵イク・セントラルバレイ、ただ今着任しました！\nご指導のほど、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "新兵育·中央谷，现在前来报到！\n今后还请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "2a99c378c79b17c61e63ad8c91059b21301125c46aeaad9b5c6e71245305c9e6", "ja": "ご苦労様！　第765特殊分遣隊『ガーデン』、隊長の\nサヨコ・ハイランドです。さあ、みんなも挨拶！", "zh": "辛苦了！我是第765特别分遣队“Garden”的队长，萨代子·海兰德。来，大家也打个招呼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "86a14f7866ac2d73395d065f1274706406bceca9fd72976ee93ccd5e7b141de6", "ja": "こんにちは♪　通信官のエミリー・バトラー、\n私も2年目の新人なので、一緒に頑張りましょうね！", "zh": "你好♪我是通讯官艾米莉·巴特勒，我也是入队第2年的新人，让我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "e33296aaaf171ffe61fa559e86c152fd34d987934e43776d34c35694d52bab0a", "ja": "副隊長のシホ・ノーマン、戦い方は自分で覚えて。\nこっちは守ってあげる余裕も、教えるヒマもないから。", "zh": "副队长志保·诺曼，战斗方式自己学会。  \n我可没余力保护你，也没时间教你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "8fb3eeb2593cfff7e030d188a22cc0e83e72877c2889fca2573dde6c8996e7c6", "ja": "！　クールでかっこいい……♪\nあっ、ごめんなさいっ。", "zh": "！好酷，好帅气……♪啊，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "e2cc38132faf8a97287914f6d3be2da23059533a80b8288ee8dafc45ca0087a3", "ja": "なんて言ってるけど、シホはちゃーんと守ったり、\n教えたりしてくれるって思うな☆", "zh": "虽然这么说，但我觉得志保一定会好好保护大家、教导大家的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "9a418e1e1a6bbf513180d0272e92e71ef1797ee67fa2bc3205f08c062c3c1a08", "ja": "ちょっ……先輩、そういう兵学校時代のノリ、\n本当にやめてください。示しがつかないでしょう！", "zh": "等……前辈，请您真的别再用那种兵学校时期的语气了。这样会带坏榜样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "6ccd3d45174ccf852e4475a77eccde42f898d4fa31c271793150ecbdfd6e65f4", "ja": "あ、怒っちゃった。ごめんね、あとでミキの\nおかかレーションあげるから、機嫌直して？", "zh": "啊，生气了。对不起嘛，之后把美希的鱼松军粮给你，所以别生气了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "42e2899383a6b011dcc35deec0b4acadcc924eb5c07a8de7777e85e728765f84", "ja": "別に怒ってないし、いらないです。\nていうか、挨拶！　副隊長命令！", "zh": "我才没有生气，也不需要。  \n话说回来，打招呼！这是副队长的命令！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "231de919dbdde017d8cba3bc444943f672b8b78f620b23b557517067623418ac", "ja": "はーい。……えっとね、ミキはミキだよ。\nけっこう強いから、困ったらミキに任せてね♪", "zh": "好——……那个，美希就是美希哦。\n我可是很强的，所以遇到麻烦就交给美希吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "57881b70c040e9179d1705e5a1813bd37b66760ae7631b51641e558125531637", "ja": "知ってます！　南洋戦区で機兵126機を撃墜した\nミキ・アルスター少尉……ずっと憧れてました！", "zh": "我知道！击落了南洋战区126架机兵的\n米基·阿尔斯特少尉……我一直都很崇拜您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "e05d343ffb5549a7cda460fd5601c96c170d7cc86ceccc9377ff5a93b1d6464b", "ja": "でも、イクさんの適合率もすごいですよね！\nこんなに小さいうちに配属されるのも頷けます。", "zh": "不过，育的适配率也很高呢！这么小就被分配到部队，确实说得通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "8a82bbc8e5aae01c9e1fe5b8ba0b47a3115408a24cb895add7bb42213a061d08", "ja": "えへへ♪　おとうさんにも、よく言われています。\nわたしは、みんなを守らなくちゃいけないんだよって！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪爸爸也经常这么说我。  \n说我一定要保护大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "8a6bb0d5bda1fe0ca1a4be80806ea35bf1af8ac9372791d25c888c1ddf37a273", "ja": "自慢のお嬢さんなのね。当面は週二で帰宅できるから、\n帰ったらたくさん親孝行してあげて。", "zh": "真是你引以为傲的女儿呢。暂时每周能回家两次，\n回去后就好好孝敬父母吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "50c07fdbb4814080f73aea40354486eaa54862fbdd8b04e6ff6bb603c27c8b7e", "ja": "こんなに小さい子まで駆り出すなんてね。\nパイロット不足はいよいよ深刻だわ。", "zh": "竟然连这么小的孩子都被派上场了。飞行员不足的问题，看来已经相当严重了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "1c1449d4329ac51a8f44dede79069186894717eb0f4b7d7e3855121adac5fd6d", "ja": "あ、あの……、わたしはまだ小さいですけど、\nちゃんとみんなを守れるように、頑張りますからっ！", "zh": "啊、那个……我虽然还小，但会努力做到好好保护大家的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "9e92d6e36f0a02b19a03fac4cad9c1472f0ef8214f3778b4a975e76f71ab9bb5", "ja": "……とりあえず、自分の足でしっかり歩いて。\n話はそれから。", "zh": "……总之，先用你自己的双脚走稳路再说。\n其他的等之后再谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "a489fba3f5166bfb72eef6f879f3dff72523f2fe53389d1df5c831be3b97c0ed", "ja": "あの、シホさん、いじわるはダメですよ？", "zh": "那个，志保小姐，不可以使坏哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "46d5a6e49ceb2adb08adf45cb99b64d8177955f3b17d2bb11725cd1b79a15087", "ja": "違うわよ。今のは、ただの……アドバイス。", "zh": "不是的。刚才那只是……建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_01_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "7cb7ee7faafc829c6989792a9eb372f97d6ba8578441b6eb971f1036f5928967", "ja": "ふふっ。改めて、『ガーデン』へようこそ！　一緒に、\nユニオン（世界統合政府）の平和を守りましょう！", "zh": "呵呵。重新向你表示欢迎来到“花园”！让我们一起守护联盟（世界统一政府）的和平吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
